{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Zanmu  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The pyramid of the Sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems to be a facility of the Lunar Capital called the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In reality, it was a shrine dedicated to the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >Ah, you're here as well.",
                "<l$> This pyramid is a magnificent sight don't you think?"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh!? Zanmu? What are you doing here?"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >I got worried, so I came."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I feared that my Gensokyo might cease had it been left alone."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Seriously? My Gensokyo?"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >Well, you’ve certainly came up with something remarkable…"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Oh, this Incident Stone...."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know how it got here, but it was very useful."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >No need to be so humble. You made that didn't you?"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Not really, I have no idea on it's creator."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >I see....In any case, there is no doubt you were the one who overcame the incident."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Pulling a stunt like crystalizing my power over nothingness."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >This pyramid, you see, has stood long before I was born."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There were even murmurs of it being a spaceship."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Not exactly a spaceship....but they're similar, in a sense."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Zanmu  >However, I had learned the story of the tragic princess sealed within here."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Observing Gensokyo's incident reminded me of that."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >I see, and that brought you here..."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Zanmu's words were comforting, there was charm to them."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems the princess of the pyramid was treated horribly for her appearance."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "While her power to create a perpetual world allowed her live, she did not have freedom."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They say this stalwart pyramid is where she had buried her heart."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Though in reality, she was neither ugly nor was had she closed her heart. Perhaps this was just another one of Zanmu's tales."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then, by the time an incident only her powers could stop occurred, she had already closed her heart."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Reimu thought the next time she entered the pyramid, she should take the princess out to meet everyone."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$ Beware Of Clever Speakers $>"
            ]
        }
    }
}